# Prometheus text exposition sample for parser tests.
# Lines are copied (trimmed) from a real GET /metrics dump of a live LiteLLM
# proxy.
# Values are the real observed values.
#
# Coverage required by the mapping spec:
#   - *_created gauges with epoch values ~1.79e9 (proxy, spend)
#   - two distinct series of litellm_requests_metric_total that differ ONLY by
#     client_ip (the dropped-label collision regression: they must yield two
#     rows with distinct delta-tracker keys)
#   - litellm_spend_metric_total
#   - litellm_input/output/total_tokens_metric_total
#   - one full latency histogram: le buckets + _sum + _count
#   - litellm_deployment_latency_per_output_token histogram
#   - litellm_remaining_tokens_metric gauge
#   - two litellm_deployment_state series: SAME model_id, two DIFFERENT
#     litellm_model_name values (0.0 healthy / 2.0 error) - composite key
#   - one litellm_deployment_cooled_down_total counter with exception_status
#   - one out-of-scope family: process_start_time_seconds
# HELP process_start_time_seconds Start time of the process since unix epoch in seconds.
# TYPE process_start_time_seconds gauge
process_start_time_seconds 1.79029082814e+09
